.Dd November 20, 2026
.Dt SHUTDOWN 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm shutdown
.Nd system power control command
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl r
.Ar now
.Nm
.Fl h
.Ar now
.Nm
.Fl p
.Ar now
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
command stops services through
.Xr svcd 8
and requests the kernel power action.
It is the administrative form of the same command documented in
.Xr shutdown 1 .
.Pp
It requires effective uid 0.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr shutdown 1 ,
.Xr svcd 8
